      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "· Do I need an Arduino to join the experience?\n· Do I need electronics experience?\n· Can I just watch online?\n· What materials do I need if I'm online?\n· Will the prototypes be finished by the end?",
